    {
      "id": "text-2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Back to Hangzhou for my mom's wontons (yay!) and slow evenings by West Lake. This time around we also visited the Leifeng Pagoda and took a small cruise along the Qiantang River, admiring the cityscape at night. So many lovely waterfront views.\n\n(Not pictured) I also did a good amount of shopping..."
