    {
      "id": "text-4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Another two day trip. As the former national capital, Nanjing wore its history brightly. We walked amongst the Confucius Temple's night market crowds and joined a river cruise at night. In the morning we walked up to the Sun Yat-sen Mausoleum."
    },
