    {
      "id": "text-5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Modern city, modern life. As my first international solo venture, I wanted to soak in the contemporary luxuries Shanghai had to offer. From the Gentle Monster to Louis Vuitton flagships, there was shopping, architecture, contemporary art, and history. One of my favorite ways to end the night was with my airpods in, walking along Nanjing Road or the Bund."
    },
