    {
      "id": "text-6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(Above) Trying on glasses at Gentle Monster and some clothes at local malls.\n\n(Left) Fotografiska Shanghai. As an enjoyer of contemporary art, I had the pleasure of viewing some exhibits here, one of them being Cho Gi-Seok's \"The Coexistence of Imperfection\", where he explores how various dichotomies work together (i.e. love & hate, nature & technology).\n\nAnd later some nightlife..."
    },
