    {
      "id": "text-7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "One experience unique to China is that they offer these very cool photoshoots for quite reasonable prices (at least if you come from the States). These photo studios offer dozens of themes to pick from, ranging from simple to extravagant.\n\nIt took me a few hours to do hair, makeup, and costume. Truly though, I'd like to shout out the photographer because I am probably the most awkward and stiff person to sign up for this (mission challenge confidence, completed). She guided me through every single pose and kept reminding me to relax my face and straighten my posture.\n\n10/10 experience and a fun way to get me out of my comfort zone."
    },
